[Warning] The 'requiredACG' field is not defined in appinfo.json.
ACG (Access Control Group) controls an app's permission to call Luna Bus APIs on webOS.
 Depending on the target webOS version, this field can be required for every app to pass the submission eligibility check - even apps that do not call any Luna APIs. 
If your app does not use Luna APIs, declare an empty array: "requiredACG": []
For details, see: https://webostv.developer.lge.com/develop/guides/acg-guide
